invariant: INV-41
file: src/rsa_mont64_blocks.c
catches: rsa_blocks_equiv_test
reason: rsa_mont64_blocks_reduce's second pass keeps a under the mask
  where it keeps a - m, so a product at or above the modulus leaves the
  blocks without its last subtraction, and one below it leaves as a - m.
  bin/rsa_blocks_equiv_test compares every multiplication and the last
  subtraction itself with the loops'.

--- old
        o[j] = (o[j] & mask) | (a[j] & ~mask);
--- new
        o[j] = (o[j] & ~mask) | (a[j] & mask);
